  "about": {
    "content": "Vivekananda Bhawan is a residential hostel at IIT Roorkee, named after Swami Vivekananda. It is home to students from different branches, years and parts of the country, who share meals in the mess, play on the same grounds and celebrate festivals together as one community. Day-to-day life in the Bhawan is managed by the wardens and office staff along with a team of student secretaries, who look after the mess, maintenance, sports, cultural and technical activities, and student wellness. Our aim is simple: to give every resident a clean, safe and friendly place to live, so they can focus on their studies and make the most of their time on campus."
